# Tarnation Vista: "{1}, {T}: For each color among monocolored permanents you control, add one mana of that color" (CR 106.5, 105.2,
# 605.1a). Bot1's Vista (choosing blue) enters tapped and its second ability is refused that turn. Turn 5 Bot1 controls two Savannah
# Lions (white, monocolored: one {W} between them), Kitchen Finks (green and white: multicolored, counts nothing: the pool would
# show {G} otherwise), an Ornithopter and Moxen (colorless, count nothing), and Bot2 a red Frenzied Goblin (an opponent's permanent
# counts nothing: {R} would show). Paying {1} from a Mox Ruby, the pool is exactly {W} and the other Moxen stay untapped (one
# generic mana paid). Turn 7 a Llanowar Elves (green) joins them: the pool is {W}{G}, the colors each once.

